d or upgrade our website or our products, excepting the personal information that you submit to us when you create a user account, send an error report."}]}, {"role": "paragraph", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "Only for the following purposes that we may use personal information submitted by you: help us develop, deliver, and improve our products and services and supply higher quality service; manage online surveys and other activities you\u2019ve participated in."}]}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "In the following circumstances, we may disclose your personal information according to your wish or regulations by law : "}, {"role": "list", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "listitem", "name": "1. Your prior permission;", "children": [{"role": "list item marker", "name": "1. "}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "Your prior permission;"}]}, {"role": "listitem", "name": "2. By the applicable law within or outside your country of residence, legal process, litigation requests;", "children": [{"role": "list item marker", "name": "2. "}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "By the applicable law within or outside your country of residence, legal process, litigation requests;"}]}, {"role": "listitem", "name": "3. By requests from public and governmental authorities;", "children": [{"role": "list item marker", "name": "3. "}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "By requests from public and governmental authorities;"}]}, {"role": "listitem", "name": "4. To protect our legal rights and interests.", "children": [{"role": "list item marker", "name": "4. "}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "To protect our legal rights and interests. "}]}]}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "NON-PERSONAL INFORMATION"}, {"role": "paragraph", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "Non-personal information is data in a form that does not permit direct association with any specific individual, such as your Android ID, CPN model, memory size, your phone IMEI number, phone model, rom, phone operator, location, install, uninstall, frequency of use, etc."}]}, {"role": "paragraph", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "We may collect and use non-personal information in the following circumstances. To have a better understanding in user\u2019s behavior, solve problems in products and services, improve our products, services and advertising, we may collect non-personal information such as the data of install, frequency of use, country, equipment and channel. "}]}, {"role": "paragraph", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "If non-personal information is combined with personal information, we treat the combined information as personal information for the purposes of this Privacy Policy."}]}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "PROTECTION OF PERSONAL INFORMATION"}, {"role": "paragraph", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "We take precautions \u2014 including administrative, technical, and physical measures \u2014 to safeguard your personal information against loss, theft, and misuse, as well as against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, and destruction."}]}, {"role": "paragraph", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "When you use some products, services, or post your comments, the personal information you share is visible to other users and can be read, collected, or used by them. You are responsible for the personal information you choose to submit in these instances. Please take care when using these features. OUR COMPANYWIDE COMMITMENT TO YOUR PRIVACY"}]}, {"role": "paragraph", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "To make sure your personal information is secure; we communicate our privacy and security guidelines to all employees and strictly enforce privacy safeguards within the company. "}]}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "buttonmenu", "name": "Share", "haspopup": "true", "children": [{"role": "section", "name": "", "childr